<title>HONG KONG: Industrial and Commercial Bk of China to set loan.</title>
<headline>Industrial and Commercial Bk of China to set loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial and Commercial Bank of China has mandated BA Asia to arrange a US$58 million loan facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of six years.</p>
<p>Repayment is in seven equal semi-annual instalments after three years grace.</p>
<p>The loan will pay an interest margin of 33 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
